טוי שהוקלד בתחום</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\( {{CT:9}} \\leq x \\leq {{CT:10}} \\)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">שגוי. התשובה הנכונה היא:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:16}}\\)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"> </p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["m1", "m2", "m3", "n1", "n2", "n3", "x0", "x1", "x2", "x3", "y0", "y1", "y2", "y3"], "nvariants": 50}